\p{In late June we had a lovely week in Sweden at the institut Mittag-Leffer for a
[workshop on formalising higher category theory](hcatml). It was interesting to
hear about other approaches people were taking and it was great to be invited,
alongisde [[fredrikbakke]], [[ulrikbuchholtz]] and [[jonathanweinberger]] to
run the '\em{simplicial HoTT}' working group. We had a lot of interest over the
week and managed to get quite a few pull requests finished from a variety of
people so it seemed like a nice idea to add a changelog entry detailing some of the
progress that was made.}


